#: ../source/back-office.rst:3
#: 4079feba21ac4a98a3a31a1b196591c2
msgid "Back office"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/back-office.rst:5
#: 70614763f5bf49cc815f60afce76f748
msgid "The back office is restricted to super users. It allows to manage the reference data used by Monitorfish :"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/back-office.rst:7
#: d6ac496fe7c541faa8ac347727da7d0c
msgid "**regulatory zones** (*\"Zones réglementaires\"*) : create and update regulated fishing areas - geometry, regulatory references, authorized or prohibited gears and species, fishing periods... See :doc:`regulation`."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/back-office.rst:9
#: a0e48d9decb0491e84a1cbc395321f4e
msgid "**control objectives** (*\"Objectifs de contrôle\"*) : set, for each year, seafront and fleet segment, the number of sea and land controls to perform and the control priority level. See :doc:`control-priority-steering`."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/back-office.rst:11
#: 58861461b9834bcda9e6bd9d19430125
msgid "**fleet segments** (*\"Segments de flotte\"*) : define the fleet segments of each year - gears, target species, mesh, FAO areas, vessel types, impact risk factor... A new year can be initialized from the segments of the previous year. See :doc:`fleet-segments`."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/back-office.rst:13
#: 39e77aa1d1254c888782777e5d43bcce
msgid "**prior notification distribution** (*\"Diffusion des préavis\"*) : define which prior notifications are sent to each control unit. See :doc:`control-units`."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/back-office.rst:15
#: 4977ed6869ee498f9bdc7ec0f4f613bc
msgid "**producer organization memberships** (*\"Adhésions aux OP\"*) : record the producer organization of vessels, used to filter the :doc:`vessel list <vessel-list>` and in :ref:`configurable alerts <configurable-alerts>`."
msgstr ""
